WEBVTT

NOTE Trailer

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.680
<v Noah Labhart>What if you had a window into the digital startup world? What if you could ask the tech veterans what it feels like to create a world-class product? How to recover from critical mistakes? How to scale your solution to the masses? How do you get from an idea on the back of a napkin to a fully functioning product? What if you could hear the human stories about how they delivered technology? What if there was a show where you could hear those stories?

2
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.240
<v Noah Labhart>This is Code Story, a podcast bringing you interviews with tech visionaries.

3
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.840
<v Clip>I spent six months moonlighting.

4
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.380
<v Clip>There's nothing at the back end.

5
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.160
<v Noah Labhart>Who share what it takes to change an industry.

6
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.860
<v Clip>I don't exactly know what to do next.

7
00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:48.480
<v Clip>It took many goes to get right.

8
00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:51.580
<v Noah Labhart>Who built the teams that have their back.

9
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.080
<v Clip>The company is its people.

10
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.480
<v Clip>The teams help each other achieve more.

11
00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.520
<v Clip>Most proud of our team.

12
00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.240
<v Noah Labhart>Keeping scalability top of mind.

13
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.400
<v Clip>Yes, we've been fighting it as we've grown.

14
00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.360
<v Clip>Total waste of time.

15
00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.880
<v Noah Labhart>The stories you don't read in the headlines.

16
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.100
<v Clip>It's not an easy thing to achieve, Mike.

17
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.160
<v Clip>Took it off the shelf and dusted it off and tried it again.

18
00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.860
<v Noah Labhart>Drive the ups and downs of the startup life.

19
00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.640
<v Clip>You need to really want it.

20
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.020
<v Clip>It's not just about technology.

21
00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.060
<v Noah Labhart>All this and more on Code Story.
